FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785259144
OL,3,CManslaughter arrest after death of
OL,4,C'devoted' mum
OL,6,FOfficers confirmed a man, 31, was
OL,7,Finitially arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcoercive and controlling behaviour,
OL,9,Fbefore being further arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of manslaughter. He has
OL,11,Fsince been released on conditional
OL,12,Fbail.
OL,14,FA second man, aged 23, was arrested in
OL,15,Frelation to the initial offence that
OL,16,Fprompted police to attend the
OL,17,Fproperty. He has also been bailed with
OL,18,Fconditions.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785259144
OL,3,CManslaughter arrest after death of
OL,4,C'devoted' mum
OL,6,FDue to prior police contact, a
OL,7,Fmandatory referral has been made to
OL,8,Fthe police watchdog, the Independent
OL,9,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC).
OL,11,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for
OL,12,FLancashire Police said it would be
OL,13,F"inappropriate to comment further
OL,14,Fabout this at this time."
OL,16,FIn a tribute released through police,
OL,17,FHannah's parents, Kevin and Sarah
OL,18,FHarcup, described their daughter as
OL,19,F"truly one of a kind" and the "light
OL,20,Fof our lives".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785259144
OL,3,CManslaughter arrest after death of
OL,4,C'devoted' mum
OL,6,F"Hannah was our beautiful and only
OL,7,Fdaughter, the light of our lives and
OL,8,Fthe love in our hearts and souls,"
OL,9,Fthey said.
OL,11,F"She was a devoted mother to her two
OL,12,Fprecious daughters, a cherished
OL,13,Fdaughter, granddaughter, sister, and a
OL,14,Floyal, loving friend to so many.
OL,16,F"At just 29 years old, Hannah's life
OL,17,Fwas far too short. She was not only
OL,18,Fbeautiful inside and out, but also
OL,19,Ffunny, bubbly, witty, and full of
OL,20,Flife, with a fantastic personality.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785259144
OL,3,CManslaughter arrest after death of
OL,4,C'devoted' mum
OL,6,F"She will always be remembered for her
OL,7,Fmadcap sense of humour, her infectious
OL,8,Flaugh, and her ability to light up
OL,9,Fevery room she entered."
OL,11,FHer parents added that Hannah's middle
OL,12,Fname, Eidann, means "Gift from God",
OL,13,Fdescribing her as "the greatest gift
OL,14,Fwe could ever have received."
OL,16,FThey added: "Gone far too soon but
OL,17,Floved beyond words and missed beyond
OL,18,Fmeasure. Until we see you again,
OL,19,FHannah, we love you to the moon, the
OL,20,Fstars, and back."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
